[18.508635, "o", "Why this score\r\n"]
[20.908635, "o", "  •  SSH OpenSSH banner with Twisted/Cowrie KEX facade — OpenSSH_8.9p1 banner with Twisted/Cowrie \r\nKEX facade: host_key prefers ssh-rsa without rsa-sha2-*; enc lacks AEAD (chacha20/gcm) but still \r\noffers CBC/3DES; MAC lacks *-etm@openssh.com; KEX includes group14-sha1 without \r\ngroup-exchange-sha256\r\n"]
[23.308635, "o", "  •  High-signal decoy fingerprint — +15% for high-signal tell(s): ssh.kex_facade\r\n"]
[25.708635, "o", "preset=both timeout=5.0s deep=False\r\n"]
