[32.310195, "o", "\r\n==========================================================\r\n  dd-honeypot stack (--deep)\r\n==========================================================\r\n  Target  : 54.204.78.207\r\n  Score   : 78%\r\n  Verdict : Confirmed Honeypot\r\n\r\n  Key findings:\r\n  • [HTTP:80] HTTP 404 serves framework session cookie — HTTP 404 with Werkzeug/3.1.8 Python/3.12.14 Set-Cookie\r\n  • [MYSQL:3306] MySQL returns ER 1156 on wrong auth packet sequence — emulator seq FSM on wrong auth sequence (1835: Expected seq(1) got seq(0))\r\n  • [SSH:22] Shell execution semantics inconsistent with real OS\r\n  • [SSH:22] Shell entropy / urandom latency anomaly — static $RANDOM values: ['Command not handled.', 'Command not handled.', 'Command not handled.']\r\n  • [SSH:22] LLM hallucination probe (experimental) — plausible fake success for 'ls --fake-flag-x99'\r\n  • [SSH:22] Auth engagement curve suggests honeypot any-password policy — random creds accepted on attempts [1, 2, 3, 4, 5]\r\n  … and 1 more (see JSON report)\r\n"]
