[46.928901, "o", "Why this score\r\n"]
[49.328901, "o", "  •  SMB TCP accepts then returns no protocol response — TCP accept; SMB/NETBIOS session timed out \r\nwithout a dialect (The NETBIOS connection with the remote host timed out.)\r\n"]
[49.329225, "o", "  •  HTTP TCP accepts then returns no response — TCP accept; request sent; no HTTP bytes before \r\ntimeout\r\n"]
[49.329565, "o", "  •  HTTP TCP accepts then returns no response — TCP accept; no HTTPS/HTTP response before timeout\r\n"]
[49.329797, "o", "  •  HTTP proxy port TCP accepts then returns no response — TCP accept; proxy request sent; no HTTP \r\nbytes before timeout\r\n"]
[49.331005, "o", "  •  Multiple ports accept TCP then return no application response — 4 silent-accept faces across \r\nhttp, httpproxy, smb\r\n  •  Multiple protocol tells corroborate the same host — +10% for 3 protocol lures (>1 at 5% each): \r\nhttp, httpproxy, smb\r\npreset=both timeout=5.0s deep=False\r\nClosed ports are skipped and do not raise the score.\r\n-p/--port selects only the listed ports (preset not applied)\r\nports http:80,443 smb:445 httpproxy:8080\r\nPublic target: operator asserted authorization via --confirm-authorized.\r\n"]
[51.731005, "o", "Nmap omitted by default; pass --with-nmap / -n for -sV/NSE tells.\r\n"]
